From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:57:47 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] scsi: ufs: exynos: zumapro: Gate the host clocks when idle

zumapro set neither UFSHCD_CAP_CLK_GATING nor
UFSHCD_CAP_HIBERN8_WITH_CLK_GATING, so the host clocks never went off at
idle. The core also holds its CPU latency request at 0 while the clocks
are on (on a host without clock scaling), so no core reached its C2
state. Gate them with the link in Hibern8 after the core's idle delay,
as gs101 and gs201 do, and as Google's driver does on zumapro: its
zuma-ufs.dtsi has no samsung,support-ah8, so it sets both caps.

Only Tensor G4 gets this. Tensor G3 keeps its own host data, with the
link active at idle, until Hibern8 has been tried there.

Tested on the Pixel 9a with
7.3.0-rc6-omamobile-tegu-s2mpg15-m1-g991042e2eff3-dirty, before the
PHY's Hibern8 sequences were added: clkgate_enable 1 with the 150 ms
default delay, pm_qos_enable left on, /dev/cpu_dma_latency idle at the
default, and in an idle minute cpu0 spent 36 s in C2, cpu4 39 s and
cpu7 41 s (0 s with the clocks held on). A cold read of 20000 files
under /usr and 30 fsync'd 8 MiB writes with idle gaps between them ran
with no UFS errors, and the root file system has been on it since boot.

Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c | 14 +++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c b/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c
index c45e64ed7..5a4b13db2 100644
--- a/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c
+++ b/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-exynos.c
@@ -278,6 +278,18 @@ static int zuma_ufs_drv_init(struct exynos_ufs *ufs)
 	return exynos_ufs_shareability(ufs);
 }
 
+static int zumapro_ufs_drv_init(struct exynos_ufs *ufs)
+{
+	/*
+	 * Idle clock gating with the link in Hibern8, as on gs101 and gs201:
+	 * it also drops the CPU latency request the core holds while the
+	 * clocks are on.
+	 */
+	ufs->hba->caps |= UFSHCD_CAP_CLK_GATING | UFSHCD_CAP_HIBERN8_WITH_CLK_GATING;
+
+	return zuma_ufs_drv_init(ufs);
+}
+
 static int exynosauto_ufs_drv_init(struct exynos_ufs *ufs)
 {
 	return exynos_ufs_shareability(ufs);
@@ -2578,7 +2590,7 @@ static const struct exynos_ufs_drv_data zumapro_ufs_drvs = {
 				  EXYNOS_UFS_OPT_CLKSTOP_PRE_CHANGE |
 				  EXYNOS_UFS_OPT_UNGATE_POST_CHANGE,
 	.iocc_mask		= UFS_GS101_SHARABLE,
-	.drv_init		= zuma_ufs_drv_init,
+	.drv_init		= zumapro_ufs_drv_init,
 	.suspend		= gs101_ufs_suspend,
 	.pre_link		= zumapro_ufs_pre_link,
 	.post_link		= zumapro_ufs_post_link,
